        "cooked": "<p>So, I plan on buying the stuff I'm missing from my set next week (all the mini-expansions), but I noticed there is no more Ambuscade :( When do you guys think you'll have more? Only one I found on Amazom was overpriced, and I'd rather buy from you guys (my FLGS doesn't carry the mini-expansions, and I did have to special order my sets)</p><p>I don't want to wait until I preorder Vengeance to buy 'em all, so if it'll be a couple weeks, maybe I'll just wait to do my mass order then.</p>",
