        "created_at": "2013-05-29T03:07:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"kakesh\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/b5ac83/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> kakesh:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So, I plan on buying the stuff I'm missing from my set next week (all the mini-expansions), but I noticed there is no more Ambuscade <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=12\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> When do you guys think you'll have more? Only one I found on Amazom was overpriced, and I'd rather buy from you guys (my FLGS doesn't carry the mini-expansions, and I did have to special order my sets)I don't want to wait until I preorder Vengeance to buy 'em all, so if it'll be a couple weeks, maybe I'll just wait to do my mass order then.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It seems like they have a shipment in june for the EE that is sold out. So it might be possible that they have more Ambuscade then.</p>",
